            <li style="padding-bottom:2%"><a class="content-link inline-link" data-link draggable="false" data-uuid="JournalEntry.JSJFLIgt8GpkqqY2.JournalEntryPage.3yaQZ57VrZ4aOvrY" data-id="3yaQZ57VrZ4aOvrY" data-type="JournalEntryPage">O Tesouro das Ruínas</a></li>
